{"id":"vod_bf_17705","vodId":"17705","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"绝对双刃","name_cn":"绝对双刃","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-18/366e811d299655f516af156b437ff208.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在名为“昊陵学园”的武术训练学校之中。拥有悲惨过去的九重透流（松冈祯丞 配音）带着满心的愤怒和抱负来到此处就读，希望能够在这里磨练技艺，变得强大替死去的妹妹报仇。　　校园中推行了一项名为“绊双刃”的特殊制度，学生们必须两两结成绊双刃，同吃同住，以加深彼此的羁绊。羁绊越深，两人得到的力量就越强大。在校园里，九重透流邂逅了名为朱莉（山本希望 配音）的北欧女孩，两人结下了羁绊，就此开始了同居生活。除此之外，傲娇任性的莉莉丝（山崎遥 配音）、迟钝耿直的橘巴（诹访彩花 配音）、身体孱弱的穗高雅（今村彩夏 饰），这些可爱的女孩们都将在学校里找到她们维系一生的羁绊。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 23:19:44","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jueduishuangren/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:33:31.286Z"}